{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0c990d84763c647cbe3ca34f76826b97e385ee13e45e812872722ebcedc632c9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"requirements.txt pins tqdm 4.65.0, transformers 4.28.1, datasets 2.11.0, huggingface-hub 0.13.4, and accelerate 0.18.0."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0c990d84763c647cbe3ca34f76826b97e385ee13e45e812872722ebcedc632c9"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_98e910f29eec44799c3330fb5d612259","id":"pg_c5b19ee2a2fb5c55988634f7d4d7bb92","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/bigcode-project-starcoder-requirements-txt-d72c7fe3dda8-34f7d4d7bb92.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_d57d60016aeb5fadb1780503ee73453c"],"title":"bigcode-project/starcoder/requirements.txt @ d72c7fe3dda8","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_98e910f29eec44799c3330fb5d612259"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1d2c1d2f625f8a80fe5c0b61e4529b9051de031afc6a9988822f69f30d9d125a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Evaluation of StarCoder and its derivatives is done with the external BigCode-Evaluation-Harness for Code LLMs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_461afc725f22b7f36ef8a4e4ba0d4e0e805507347f57f20844c7af18f5bd3608"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Using the model requires accepting an agreement on hf.co/bigcode/starcoder and logging into the Hugging Face hub with huggingface-cli login."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5f88b744e01777170b4d260b247b221c106c292134f51666123a099b459a2caa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: setup involves installing libraries from requirements.txt via pip, and fine-tuning setup uses a conda environment with pytorch, transformers, peft, datasets, accelerate, huggingface_hub, bitsandbytes, and wandb."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7adfa8cfe3e6cdecb65bd2b16eb7759f38583bda10dc503e187247aa598166f0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README shows serving via the text-generation-inference Docker image with --model-id bigcode/starcoder and --max-total-tokens 8192, using a BigCode-enabled Hugging Face token."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7c73342ec232b1b8bca5f104a1ef8449a3c7b3cbf7b2cd9d078e66f3beea6930"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"In FP32 the model needs over 60GB of RAM; loading in FP16/BF16 takes about 30GB, and 8-bit loading under 20GB (reported footprint ~15.9GB)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_90c561487b46d1513df61631de4c28e9118d682b9322ad1734df9c773d18b15e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: fine-tuning is run with finetune/finetune.py using the stack-exchange-instruction dataset, streaming, seq_length 2048, cosine LR schedule, and related hyperparameters; a torch.distributed.launch variant supports multiple GPUs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_afb0a45dbe84d161653f10219ff980cdbec3d0b47496c2f92c04f0a6ad0b853d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README shows the model can run on either GPU (cuda) or CPU, with the device selected in the loading example."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c1bf9939ee2f17d1d8ef1a60b79cd683efb8ab0a4648275009473eba5dabe245"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"StarCoder is a language model trained on source code and natural-language text covering more than 80 programming languages, plus text from GitHub issues, commits, and notebooks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cbb3edc069e2e8e7e5eb0d555879a5f471e99845cddfc9c2af3a9a216882fd57"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A fine-tuned StarCoder chat assistant variant was announced in May 2023, with training code in the chat/ directory and a hosted playground."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ebc25651e1d1ad21562e22a4c3b4b2cece456a8eacafdcbdf4c2d6c6a8884999"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The model is served from the checkpoint bigcode/starcoder and can be used through Hugging Face transformers AutoModelForCausalLM/AutoTokenizer or a text-generation pipeline."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ecdaaa4bfa480dc442ee415b577c0719409c521f5d3601fc3fb19ff9e049aaea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: models trained with PEFT must have adapter layers merged into the base model via finetune/merge_peft_adapters.py before inference or evaluation, with an optional --push_to_hub flag."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1d2c1d2f625f8a80fe5c0b61e4529b9051de031afc6a9988822f69f30d9d125a","clm_461afc725f22b7f36ef8a4e4ba0d4e0e805507347f57f20844c7af18f5bd3608","clm_5f88b744e01777170b4d260b247b221c106c292134f51666123a099b459a2caa","clm_7adfa8cfe3e6cdecb65bd2b16eb7759f38583bda10dc503e187247aa598166f0","clm_7c73342ec232b1b8bca5f104a1ef8449a3c7b3cbf7b2cd9d078e66f3beea6930","clm_90c561487b46d1513df61631de4c28e9118d682b9322ad1734df9c773d18b15e","clm_afb0a45dbe84d161653f10219ff980cdbec3d0b47496c2f92c04f0a6ad0b853d","clm_c1bf9939ee2f17d1d8ef1a60b79cd683efb8ab0a4648275009473eba5dabe245","clm_cbb3edc069e2e8e7e5eb0d555879a5f471e99845cddfc9c2af3a9a216882fd57","clm_ebc25651e1d1ad21562e22a4c3b4b2cece456a8eacafdcbdf4c2d6c6a8884999","clm_ecdaaa4b